<title>USA: PCX to trade eight new options from May 14.</title>
<headline>PCX to trade eight new options from May 14.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Exchange (PCX) said Friday it would list options on eight stocks on May 14.</p>
<p>The stocks are Beacon Properties Corp, Cavalier Homes Inc, Diagnostic Health Services Inc, Liberty Property Trust, National Instruments Corp, Pioneer-Standard Electronics Inc, Spieker Properties Inc and Steel Dynamics Inc.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
